sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Owner device
  participant G as Auth and turn controller
  participant R as Memory retrieval
  participant D as Shared store
  participant M as Eligible reasoning lane
  participant V as Response and Amy
  U->>G: Request with device session and request ID
  G->>G: Verify scope, privacy, deadline and current turn
  G->>R: Authorized query and context budget
  R->>D: Scoped exact / keyword / qualified vector search
  D-->>R: Active facts, source IDs, revisions and valid times
  R-->>G: Bounded evidence packet or no reliable match
  alt Exact fact or deterministic command
    G->>V: Verified direct response
  else Public model is eligible
    G->>G: Exclude all personal records from public payload
    G->>M: Public context only, bounded generation
    M-->>G: Incremental answer candidates
    G->>V: Checked sentence chunks with request ID
  else Private reasoning unavailable
    G->>V: Explain limitation or ask focused clarification
  end
  V-->>U: Text and first playable audio
  opt User stops or a newer turn supersedes this one
    U->>G: Cancel request ID
    G->>M: Cancel best effort
    G->>V: Stop playback and discard stale chunks
    G->>R: Cancel pending retrieval
  end
  Note over G,D: Retrieval never grants write or device-action authority
  Note over G,V: Proposed streaming, existing full-reply path retained until accepted
